  // is 0.5% of the $1,000 capital ($5.00).
  function playbookDisclosuresHtml() {
    return '<p class="fine"><b>What this costing leaves out.</b> Deposit/withdrawal assumed $0 (not verified per-protocol; would be $5.00 at 0.5% of the $1,000 capital). Slippage not modeled (0.30% = pool fee only). Bridge $2.00 flat per non-Ethereum chain (point estimate). Gas snapshot ' + esc(DATA.as_of) + '. Opportunity cost is NOT subtracted: the board costs gas + swaps only; the T-bill return (4.5% a year, $11.10 on $1,000 over 90 days) is the hurdle a FARM row’s $/hour must beat, not a cost. The 12 weekly actions are not costed as transactions (gasless votes or check-ins); if a protocol requires a weekly on-chain transaction, add 12 × gas. Counts 5 transactions on the primary chain (fund, deposit ×2, claim, exit) + 1 on a second chain where the plan repeats there.</p>';
  }
  // The extra-fee split as one line: swap / bridge (chain count) / gas
