      '<tr><td>Maturity (' + fmtAge(row.age_days) + ' old)' + (MODEL.maturityRange === 0 ? ' — dropped in round 8' : '') + '</td><td class="num">' + b.mat.toFixed(3) + 'x</td><td class="num">' + fmtUsd(afterMat) + '</td></tr>' +
      '<tr><td>Token odds (P records a token)</td><td class="num">' + b.odds.toFixed(2) + '</td><td class="num">' + fmtUsd(afterOdds) + '</td></tr>' +
      '<tr><td><b>Implied value (expected)</b></td><td class="num"></td><td class="num"><b>' + fmtUsd(row.implied_value_usd) + '</b></td></tr>' +
      '</tbody></table>' +
      '<p class="fine">The value if a token launches is ' + fmtUsd(row.model.value_if_launches) + '; the implied value is that, times the ' + (b.odds * 100).toFixed(0) + '% token odds. The farm verdict on this row is ' + verdictLabel(row.farm.verdict) + ' (net EV ' + (row.farm.netEv >= 0 ? '+' : '') + fmtUsd2(row.farm.netEv) + ') — the biggest implied value is not the best farm, because the pool is a share of TVL and this row’s TVL is the largest on the board. Open the row for the full derivation and farm plan.</p></div>';
    return h;
